### Anchor API — REST Client collection (VS Code "REST Client" / JetBrains .http)
### Run the requests top-to-bottom; `login` captures a bearer token reused below.
### Mirrors docs/nexus/artifacts/api/openapi.yaml.

@base = http://localhost:4000/api/v1

### Liveness / readiness
GET {{base}}/../healthz

###
GET {{base}}/../readyz

### --- Auth -------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/dev-login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "agent@nexus.example.com" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Local login (password account)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "you@acme.com", "password": "change-me-please" }

### Self-service signup (creates org + Org Admin)
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "organizationName": "Acme Corp", "email": "admin@acme.test", "password": "supersecret10", "cloud": "commercial" }

### Current principal
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- Organizations & users ---------------------------------------------------
GET {{base}}/organizations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- Tickets -----------------------------------------------------------------
# @name createTicket
POST {{base}}/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-{{$guid}}

{ "type": "incident", "subject": "VPN drops every few minutes", "description": "Repros on Wi-Fi", "impact": 2, "urgency": 2, "organizationId": "REPLACE_WITH_ORG_ID" }

###
@ticketId = {{createTicket.response.body.id}}

### List tickets (RLS-scoped)
GET {{base}}/tickets?limit=15&status=in_progress
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one ticket (comments, events, SLA, tasks, links)
GET {{base}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Comment
POST {{base}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "body": "Investigating now.", "visibility": "internal" }

### Assign to me
POST {{base}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "assignedAgentId": "{{login.response.body.principal.id}}" }

### Transition
POST {{base}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "to": "in_progress" }

### Escalate (reassign ownership to a tier)
POST {{base}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}/escalate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "targetGroup": "Tier 2 — M365 Administrator", "reason": "needs M365 admin" }

### --- Service catalog ----------------------------------------------------------
GET {{base}}/catalog
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Submit a catalog request
POST {{base}}/catalog/account.password_reset/request
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "subject": "Password reset for new hire", "organizationId": "REPLACE_WITH_ORG_ID" }

### --- Posture -----------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{base}}/posture/score?organizationId=REPLACE_WITH_ORG_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/posture/findings?severity=high&organizationId=REPLACE_WITH_ORG_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- On-call ------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{base}}/oncall/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/oncall/pages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- Analytics ----------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{base}}/analytics/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- Automations --------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{base}}/automations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- Compliance ---------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{base}}/compliance/coverage?organizationId=REPLACE_WITH_ORG_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- Audit (tamper-evident) ---------------------------------------------------
GET {{base}}/audit-logs?limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Verify hash chain
GET {{base}}/audit/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### SIEM export (NDJSON or CEF)
GET {{base}}/audit/export?format=cef
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
